// tables, round trips and transitivity, and input errors. The REF_* tables are regression values
// generated by an external reference implementation (not part of this release) at the 17 latitudes below;
// they are not scientific sources. Do not edit them by hand. The geoid harmonization layer is not part of
// this release and is not tested here.
